     "explanation": "Affiliative leaders prioritize bonds, which is healing in tough times. But when affiliative is the ONLY tool, harmony becomes the unspoken goal — and underperformance is tolerated to avoid friction. Pair affiliative with Visionary (direction) or Coaching (growth) to balance this.",
